# Documentation
This folder contains project documentation, diagrams, and workflow explanations.

#workflow.md
Databricks → Snowflake → Power BI
## ETL Workflow
1. Raw CSV ingested into Databricks.
2. Data cleaned & enriched (GrossMargin, NetRevenue, SalesYear, SalesMonth).
3. Curated view published to Snowflake.
4. Power BI connected to Snowflake for dashboards.

